@@ -0,0 +1,67 @@
+{% extends "base.html" %}
+{% block title %}Delete your account — EraVenda{% endblock %}
+{% block meta_description %}How to delete your EraVenda account and what happens to your data.{% endblock %}
+
+{% block content %}
+<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
+  <h1 class="font-head text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Delete your account</h1>
+  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">You can delete your EraVenda account yourself at any time.</p>
+
+  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-6 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
+
+    <section>
+      <h2 class="font-head text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">How to delete it</h2>
+      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1">
+        <li>Open the EraVenda app and sign in.</li>
+        <li>Go to <strong>Account</strong>, then <strong>Delete account</strong>.</li>
+        <li>Read what will happen, enter your password, type <strong>DELETE</strong> and confirm.</li>
+      </ol>
+      <p class="mt-3">
+        Can't use the app, or can't sign in? <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Contact us</a>
+        from the email address on your account and we will help you close it.
+      </p>
+    </section>
+
+    <section>
+      <h2 class="font-head text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">What is deleted</h2>
+      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
+        <li>Your name, email address, phone number, password, profile photo and location.</li>
+        <li>Your saved addresses, cart, wishlist and the stores you follow.</li>
+        <li>Your notification settings and the phones registered for notifications.</li>
+        <li>The text of reviews you wrote, newsletter sign-ups and contact-form messages sent from your email.</li>
+        <li>If you sold on EraVenda: your store's name, description, logo, banner and registration number. Your store is closed and its products are hidden.</li>
+      </ul>
+    </section>
+
+    <section>
+      <h2 class="font-head text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">What we keep</h2>
+      <p>
+        We keep order, payment and receipt records for as long as the law requires, typically up to six years under
+        Ghanaian law, for tax, accounting and dispute purposes. After deletion they are no longer linked to your name,
+        email or phone number. The delivery details on past orders are reduced to the region and city. Star ratings you gave
+        stay so that product ratings remain accurate. Payment details are held by our payment provider, Paystack,
+        under its own policy; we never see your full card or mobile-money details.
+      </p>
+    </section>
+
+    <section>
+      <h2 class="font-head text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">When you can't delete yet</h2>
+      <p>
+        We ask you to finish what is in progress first, so nobody is left waiting for an order or a payout. Deletion is
+        unavailable while you have orders that are unpaid, being prepared or on the way, service bookings that are not
+        finished, or (for stores) orders or payouts still in progress. The app tells you exactly what to finish.
+      </p>
+    </section>
+
+    <section>
+      <h2 class="font-head text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">It cannot be undone</h2>
+      <p>
+        Once your account is deleted we cannot restore it. You are welcome to create a new account at any time.
+        Questions? <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Contact us</a> or read our
+        <a href="/privacy" class="text-brand-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
+      </p>
+    </section>
+
+  </div>
+</div>
+{% endblock %}
